msgid "Selected pending tasks are listed below. Choose a Stock Batch for each task and save."
msgstr "下面是选中的待放置任务，请为每个任务选择库存批次后保存。"


msgid "Only the most recent samples are listed. A search dialog can be added later."
msgstr "只列出最近的样品，后续可以加搜索框弹窗选择。"

msgid "Please select at least one task."
msgstr "请至少选择一个任务。"

msgid "Sample Placement can only be applied to timepoints that have not been generated yet."
msgstr "只有尚未登样的时间点可以做样品放置。"

