msgstr "TP {0}（0 点）"

msgid "Sample Automation"
msgstr "样品自动化"

msgid "Sample Template"
msgstr "样品模板"


msgid "Create samples automatically"
msgstr "自动登样"

msgid "Plans created from this template inherit this switch. When it is on, samples are created for every timepoint whose target date has arrived; the zero point is not created but linked to an existing sample. Needs the site wide switch to be on as well."
msgstr "用该模板创建的方案会继承此开关。开启后，凡是目标日期已到的时间点都会自动生成样品；零点不生成样品，而是关联已有样品。还需站点级总开关同时开启。"

msgid "Contact person used when samples are created automatically. A plan may override it."
msgstr "自动生成样品时使用的联系人，方案上可覆盖。"

msgid "Inherited from the plan template when the plan is created. When it is on, samples are created for every timepoint whose target date has arrived; the zero point is linked to an existing sample instead. The site wide switch must be on as well."
msgstr "创建方案时从方案模板继承。开启后，凡是目标日期已到的时间点都会自动生成样品；零点改为关联已有样品。站点级总开关也必须开启。"

msgid "Contact person used when samples are created automatically. Defaults to the contact of the plan template."
msgstr "自动生成样品时使用的联系人，默认取方案模板上的联系人。"

msgid "Stability Sample Automation"
msgstr "稳定性自动登样"

msgid "Site wide defaults for the automatic sample creation of stability studies. The generation time is read from here, so changing it does not require touching the server scheduler."
msgstr "稳定性研究自动登样的站点级默认设置。生成时刻从这里读取，改它不需要动服务器上的定时任务。"

msgid "Enable automatic sample creation"
msgstr "启用自动登样"

msgid "Master switch for the whole site. When it is off, no sample is created automatically; creating samples by hand still works."
msgstr "全站总开关。关闭后不会自动生成任何样品；手工建样不受影响。"

msgid "Time of day for automatic creation"
msgstr "每日生成时刻"

msgid "24-hour HH:MM (default 08:00). A timepoint whose target date is today is handled once the current time has passed this value. The scheduled task may run more often; the time is read from this setting, not from the scheduler."
msgstr "24 小时制 HH:MM，默认 08:00。目标日期是「今天」的时间点，会在当前时间过了这个时刻之后处理。定时任务可以跑得更频繁；时刻以本配置为准，不写死在调度器里。"

msgid "Create samples N days before the target date"
msgstr "提前多少天生成样品"

msgid "0 = create on the target date itself (default)."
msgstr "0 = 目标日期当天生成（默认）。"

msgid "Zero point: look-back window (days)"
msgstr "零点可关联回溯窗口（天）"

msgid "How far back from T0 a sample may be dated to be linked as the zero point sample (default 30)."
msgstr "零点所关联的往期样品，其样品日期最多可早于 T0 多少天（默认 30）。"

msgid "Generate Samples"
msgstr "生成样品（登样）"


msgid "Planned Sampling Date"
msgstr "计划取样日期"

msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

msgid "Will be created"
msgstr "将创建样品"

msgid "Generate"
msgstr "生成"

msgid "Analyses"
msgstr "检验项"

msgid "Generated At"
msgstr "登样时间"

msgid "Generated By"
msgstr "登样人"


msgid "The zero point is not created here: link an existing sample instead."
msgstr "零点不在这里生成样品，请改用「关联已有样品」。"

msgid "Sample automation is not fully configured for this plan:"
msgstr "该方案的自动登样配置不完整："


msgid "Zero point: link an existing sample instead of creating one."
msgstr "零点是「关联已有样品」，不新建样品。"

msgid "Only timepoints in Pending Placement can be generated."
msgstr "只有「待放置」的时间点可以登样。"

msgid "A sample has already been generated for this timepoint."
msgstr "该时间点已经登过样了。"

msgid "No target date: the plan has no Start Time (T0)."
msgstr "没有目标日期：方案没有填写起始时间（T0）。"

msgid "The plan details changed since this page was opened. Please select the rows again."
msgstr "页面打开之后方案明细已被修改，请重新选择时间点。"

msgid "The selected timepoint no longer exists."
msgstr "所选时间点已不存在。"

msgid "Sample generation failed."
msgstr "登样失败。"



msgid "The plan has no Contact."
msgstr "方案上没有选择联系人。"


msgid "The Sample Template has no Sample Type."
msgstr "样品模板没有样品类型。"

msgid "The Sample Template has no analyses."
msgstr "样品模板没有配置检验项。"

msgid "Generated {0} sample(s)."
msgstr "已生成 {0} 个样品。"

msgid "Skipped {0} timepoint(s): {1}"
msgstr "已跳过 {0} 个时间点：{1}"

msgid "The selected stability plan could not be found (stale reference)."
msgstr "所选稳定性方案已找不到（引用可能已失效）。"

msgid "The client the samples are created for: samples are registered under this client. Defaults to the client of the plan template."
msgstr "登样时样品登记到哪个委托方名下：样品会建在该客户下。新建方案时会从方案模板带入默认值。"

msgid "Default client for plans created from this template. The samples are registered under the client configured on the plan."
msgstr "用该模板新建方案时带入的默认客户。实际登样以**方案上**配置的客户为准。"


msgid "No Client is configured for this plan."
msgstr "方案上没有选择客户。"


msgid "The Contact belongs to another client than the samples are created for."
msgstr "联系人与样品将要登记到的客户不是同一个客户。"

msgid "Samples are created from the Sample Template configured on each timepoint: the sample type and the analyses come from that template, the client and the contact come from the plan. The Date Sampled is left empty."
msgstr "样品按**该时间点行上配置的样品模板**创建：样品类型与检验项取自该模板，客户与联系人取自方案；不填写「实际取样日期」。"

msgid "This timepoint has no Sample Template."
msgstr "该时间点没有选择样品模板。"

msgid "Sample type and analyses for this timepoint come from this template: samples are created with the template's analyses."
msgstr "该时间点的样品类型与检验项来自这个样品模板：登样时就按模板里的检验项生成样品。"

msgid "The Client of the plan does not match the client the Sample Template of this timepoint belongs to."
msgstr "方案上的客户与该时间点样品模板归属的客户不一致。"

# ---- 客户/联系人不一致（2026-09-29）----

msgid "The Contact "{contact}" belongs to "{contact_client}", but the samples are created for "{client}"."
msgstr "联系人“{contact}”属于“{contact_client}”，而样品将要登记到的客户是“{client}”。"

msgid "The Sample Template "{template}" belongs to "{template_client}", but the samples are created for "{client}"."
msgstr "样品模板“{template}”属于“{template_client}”，而样品将要登记到的客户是“{client}”。"

msgid "The Contact "{contact}" belongs to "{contact_client}" and does not match the Client "{client}": the Contact was cleared. Please select a Contact of "{client}"."
msgstr "联系人“{contact}”属于“{contact_client}”，与客户“{client}”不是同一家，已清空；请重新选择“{client}”的联系人。"


# ---- 先放置、再登样（2026-09-29）----

msgid "Placed"
msgstr "已放置"

msgid "This timepoint is completed and can no longer be generated."
msgstr "该时间点已完成，不能再登样。"


# ---- 0 点关联往期样品（阶段 3，2026-09-29）----

msgid "Select Target Timepoint"
msgstr "选择目标时间点"

msgid "Window"
msgstr "可关联窗口"

msgid "Sample ID"
msgstr "样品编号"

msgid "Date"
msgstr "日期"

msgid "Sampled Date"
msgstr "取样日期"

msgid "Created Date"
msgstr "创建日期"

msgid "Linked To"
msgstr "已关联到"

msgid "Candidate Samples"
msgstr "候选样品"

msgid "Show samples of all clients"
msgstr "显示全部客户的样品"

msgid "Only the plan client's samples are listed."
msgstr "当前只列出方案客户的样品。"

msgid "Only samples in the window [T0 - N, T0] are listed: a sample without a Sampled Date is matched by its creation date."
msgstr "只列出可关联窗口 [T0 - N, T0] 内的样品；没有「取样日期」的样品按「创建日期」匹配。"

msgid "No candidate samples match this window."
msgstr "这个窗口内没有可关联的候选样品。"

msgid "Link"
msgstr "关联"

msgid "Linked sample {sample} to {plan} / {task}."
msgstr "已把样品 {sample} 关联到 {plan} / {task}。"

msgid "Only the zero point can be linked to an existing sample. Please use Generate for the other timepoints."
msgstr "只有零点（0 点）可以关联已有的往期样品；其它时间点请用「生成」。"

msgid "Only the zero point can be linked to an existing sample. Please use Create Sample for the other timepoints."
msgstr "只有零点（0 点）可以关联已有的往期样品；其它时间点请用「创建样品」。"

msgid "The selected sample does not exist any more."
msgstr "选中的样品已经不存在了。"

msgid "The sample date {date} is outside the allowed window ({start} ~ {end}) for this timepoint."
msgstr "样品日期 {date} 不在该时间点的可关联窗口（{start} ~ {end}）内。"

msgid "This sample is already linked to {plan} / {task}."
msgstr "这个样品已经关联到 {plan} / {task} 了。"

msgid "The plan has no Start Time (T0), so there is no window to link samples from."
msgstr "方案没有填「开始时间（T0）」，因此没有可关联的窗口。"

msgid "Linking the sample failed."
msgstr "关联样品失败。"

msgid "This timepoint already has a sample linked."
msgstr "这个时间点已经关联过样品了。"

msgid "Please select a timepoint and a sample."
msgstr "请选择时间点与样品。"


# ---- 0 点提示（B 方案，2026-09-30）----

msgid "Zero Point (baseline) is not defined in this plan."
msgstr "本方案没有定义 0 点（基线点）。"

msgid "Without a zero point (Timepoint (Months) = 0) no past sample can be linked as the baseline of this plan: add a row with Timepoint (Months) = 0, then use Link Existing Sample on the task board."
msgstr "没有 0 点（时间点（月）= 0）就无法关联往期样品作为本方案的基线：请新增一行、把「时间点（月）」选为 0，然后在任务看板上用「关联已有样品」。"

msgid "These plans have no zero point row:"
msgstr "下列方案没有 0 点行："

msgid "Without a zero point (Timepoint (Months) = 0) no past sample can be linked as the baseline of these plans. Add a row with Timepoint (Months) = 0 to each of them."
msgstr "没有 0 点（时间点（月）= 0）就无法关联往期样品作为这些方案的基线。请为每个方案新增一行、把「时间点（月）」选为 0。"

msgid "None of the selected timepoints is a zero point: only the zero point (Timepoint (Months) = 0) can be linked to an existing past sample."
msgstr "选中的时间点里没有 0 点：只有 0 点（时间点（月）= 0）可以关联已有的往期样品。"

msgid "Zero Point"
msgstr "0 点"

msgid "This row is the zero point (baseline) of the plan: if you delete it, no past sample can be linked as the baseline. Delete this row?"
msgstr "这一行是方案的 0 点（基线点）：删掉之后本方案将无法关联基线样品。确定删除这一行吗？"


# ---- 0 点提示（B 方案，2026-09-30）----

msgid "({0} plans in total)"
msgstr "（共 {0} 份方案）"


# ---- 0 点提示（B 方案，2026-09-30）----

msgid "Zero Point (baseline) is not defined in this plan: add a row with Timepoint (Months) = 0 and select it here, otherwise no past sample can be linked as the baseline."
msgstr "本方案没有 0 点（基线点）：请先在方案明细里新增一行、把「时间点（月）」选为 0，再回到这里选中它；否则无法关联往期样品作为基线。"


# ---- 0 点提示（B 方案，2026-09-30）----

msgid "A zero point row (Timepoint (Months) = 0) was added to the new plan: it can be deleted or changed later."
msgstr "新建方案默认带了一行 0 点（时间点（月）= 0）：可以删掉，也可以改成别的时间点。"


# ---- 阶段 4：到期自动登样 + 撤销登样（2026-09-30）----

msgid "Sample registration revoked for {plan} / {task}."
msgstr "已撤销 {plan} / {task} 的登样。"

msgid "The plan details changed since this page was opened. Please open the page again."
msgstr "方案明细在打开本页之后被改过，请重新打开本页。"

msgid "This timepoint has no sample registered, so there is nothing to revoke."
msgstr "这个时间点没有登记样品，没有可撤销的内容。"

msgid "This timepoint is completed: its sample registration cannot be revoked any more."
msgstr "这个时间点已完成，它的登样不能再撤销。"

msgid "A reason is required to revoke a sample registration."
msgstr "撤销登样必须填写原因。"

msgid "Revoking the sample registration failed."
msgstr "撤销登样失败。"

msgid "You do not have permission to revoke sample registrations."
msgstr "你没有撤销登样的权限。"

msgid "Please select exactly one timepoint to revoke."
msgstr "撤销登样一次只能选一个时间点。"

msgid "Revoke Sample Registration"
msgstr "撤销登样"

msgid "Last revoke"
msgstr "上次撤销"

msgid "Revoking only removes the link between this timepoint and the sample. The sample itself is NOT deleted: if it has to be cancelled, do that from the sample page."
msgstr "撤销只解除「这个时间点 ↔ 样品」的关联，**不会删除样品对象**；样品本身需要取消请到样品页处理。"

msgid "The status goes back to Pending Placement (or Placed, if a stock batch was already assigned) and the row can be deleted again."
msgstr "状态退回「待放置」（如果已经放过库存批次，则退回「已放置」），该行重新可以删除。"

msgid "This timepoint has no revocable sample registration."
msgstr "这个时间点没有可撤销的登样记录。"

msgid "Reason"
msgstr "原因"

msgid "Required. It is stored in the row notes together with who and when."
msgstr "必填。会与「谁、何时」一起写进该行的备注。"

msgid "Generate Due Samples"
msgstr "生成到期样品"

msgid "Due samples: scanned {plans} plan(s), created {created} sample(s), skipped {skipped} row(s)."
msgstr "到期登样：扫描 {plans} 个方案，生成 {created} 个样品，跳过 {skipped} 行。"

msgid "{count} row(s) could not be generated: check the Sample Template and the plan configuration."
msgstr "另有 {count} 行未能生成：请检查样品模板与方案配置。"

msgid "Generating due samples failed. Please check the log."
msgstr "生成到期样品失败，请查看日志。"

msgid "Actions"
msgstr "操作"

msgid "Revoke"
msgstr "撤销"


msgid "A paused plan stops generating samples automatically; all operations on its timepoints are frozen until it is resumed."
msgstr "暂停后该方案不再自动生成样品；其时间点上的一切操作都将冻结，直到恢复为止。"

msgid "Active Plans"
msgstr "进行中的方案"

msgid "Actor"
msgstr "操作人"

msgid "All Plans"
msgstr "全部方案"

msgid "All samples of this plan are finished."
msgstr "该方案的所有样品均已完成。"

msgid "Changing the status is recorded in the audit trail together with who did it, when, and the reason."
msgstr "状态变更会连同操作人、时间与原因一起记入审计追踪。"

msgid "Current Status"
msgstr "当前状态"

msgid "Finished"
msgstr "已完成"

msgid "From"
msgstr "原状态"

msgid "Last Status Change"
msgstr "上次状态变更"

msgid "New Status"
msgstr "新状态"

msgid "No status change has been recorded yet."
msgstr "尚未记录任何状态变更。"

msgid "Pause"
msgstr "暂停"

msgid "Pause the selected stability plan"
msgstr "暂停选中的稳定性方案"

msgid "Paused"
msgstr "已暂停"

msgid "Plan Status"
msgstr "方案状态"

msgid "Plan status filters"
msgstr "方案状态筛选"

msgid "Please select exactly one stability plan: the plan status is changed one plan at a time."
msgstr "请只选择一个稳定性方案：方案状态一次只能变更一个方案。"

msgid "Please select one stability plan first."
msgstr "请先选择一个稳定性方案。"

msgid "Required. It is recorded in the audit trail and shown on the plan page."
msgstr "必填。会记入审计追踪，并显示在方案页上。"

msgid "Resume"
msgstr "恢复"

msgid "Resume the selected stability plan"
msgstr "恢复选中的稳定性方案"

msgid "Sample Status"
msgstr "样品状态"

msgid "Status History"
msgstr "状态变更历史"

msgid "Terminate"
msgstr "终止"

msgid "Terminate the selected stability plan (final)"
msgstr "终止选中的稳定性方案（终态，不可恢复）"

msgid "Terminated"
msgstr "已终止"

msgid "Terminated Plans"
msgstr "已终止的方案"

msgid "Terminating is final: a terminated plan cannot be resumed, and its samples are not changed in any way."
msgstr "终止是终态：已终止的方案不能恢复，其样品也不会被做任何改动。"

msgid "The selected stability plan could not be found."
msgstr "找不到所选的稳定性方案。"

msgid "The stability plan cannot be changed to the requested state from its current state."
msgstr "该稳定性方案无法从当前状态变更到请求的状态。"

msgid "This plan has unfinished samples. Terminating the plan stops all further operations on its timepoints. Please review the list below before continuing."
msgstr "该方案有未完成的样品。终止后将停止该方案时间点上的一切操作，请先核对下面的清单再继续。"

msgid "This plan is paused. All operations on its timepoints are frozen until it is resumed."
msgstr "该方案已暂停，其时间点上的所有操作都将冻结，直到恢复为止。"

msgid "This plan is terminated."
msgstr "该方案已终止。"

msgid "This stability plan cannot be edited in its current state."
msgstr "该稳定性方案在当前状态下不能编辑。"

msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "未知"

msgid "Unsupported action."
msgstr "不支持的动作。"

msgid "You do not have permission to change the status of a stability plan."
msgstr "您没有变更稳定性方案状态的权限。"

msgid "{count} paused or terminated plan(s) were skipped: all operations on their timepoints are frozen."
msgstr "已跳过 {count} 个已暂停或已终止的方案：其时间点上的一切操作均已冻结。"


msgid "Resumed. Please check the timepoints that expired during the pause and the Start Time (T0) before the next automatic scan runs."
msgstr "已恢复。下一次自动扫描运行前，请检查暂停期间已过期的时间点与起始时间（T0）。"


msgid "This timepoint has expired and can no longer be generated."
msgstr "该时间点已过期，不能再登样。"

msgid "This timepoint has expired and can no longer be linked to a sample."
msgstr "该时间点已过期，不能再关联样品。"


msgid "A reason is required to change the status of a stability plan."
msgstr "变更稳定性方案状态时必须填写原因。"

msgid "This stability plan is paused. All operations on it are frozen."
msgstr "该方案已暂停：其时间点上的一切操作均已冻结。"

msgid "This stability plan is terminated."
msgstr "该方案已终止。"

msgid "Paused or terminated plans are frozen: their timepoints cannot be modified."
msgstr "已暂停或已终止的方案已冻结：其时间点不能再修改。"























msgid "Some timepoint rows could not be read and were dropped. Please reload the page and fill them in again."
msgstr "有部分时间点行没能读出来，已被丢弃。请刷新页面后重新填写。"

msgid "The timepoint rows could not be read, so they were left unchanged. Please reload the page and try again."
msgstr "时间点明细没能读出来，本次未做任何改动。请刷新页面后重试。"


msgid "The timepoint rows of this plan could not be verified, so they were left unchanged."
msgstr "本方案的时间点明细没有通过校验，本次未做改动。"

msgid "Discarded"
msgstr "已废弃"

msgid "Discarded at"
msgstr "废弃时间"

msgid "Discarded by"
msgstr "废弃人"

msgid "Discard reason"
msgstr "废弃原因"

msgid "Set when the timepoint row was deleted (status deleted)."
msgstr "时间点行被删除（状态删除）时写入。"

msgid "Optional: why the timepoint row was discarded."
msgstr "选填：该时间点行为什么被废弃。"

msgid "Only timepoints that have not been generated yet can be deleted."
msgstr "只有「还没登样」的时间点可以删除。"

msgid "Cannot delete: this timepoint has already started"
msgstr "不能删除：该时间点已经开始"

msgid "The sample {sample} of this timepoint is not finished. Please finish or cancel it before deleting this timepoint."
msgstr "该时间点关联的样品 {sample} 尚未完成，请先完成或取消该样品再删除本时间点。"

msgid "The timepoint has been deleted (status deleted) and is kept in the plan for traceability. Use the Discarded filter on the task board to see it."
msgstr "该时间点已删除（状态删除），为保留溯源而留在方案中；可在任务看板的「已废弃」筛选里查看。"

msgid "The timepoint rows could not be fully read, so no timepoint was deleted. Please reload the page and try again."
msgstr "时间点明细没能完整读出来，本次没有删除任何时间点。请刷新页面后重试。"

msgid "An expired timepoint cannot be edited; delete it or add a new timepoint instead."
msgstr "已过期的时间点不能编辑，请删除它或另行新增时间点。"
